      "side": 1,
      "message": "A few thoughts on this:\n\n1. In this particular case, I\u0027m pretty confident no important checked-in code is parsing this output right now.  Searching both internal and public CrOS codebases for `print_only` doesn\u0027t find anything that looks like a `servo_updater` call.\n\n1. That said, I think `--print_only` isn\u0027t the ideal name for a JSON output option, though it could live on as a (deprecated) alternate option name I guess.\n\nGiven the above, how about:\n\n1. This CL proceeds as-is.\n1. Follow up with a CL that adds a JSON output option (`--json` or any better name that you prefer).\n1. Optional: If you feel `--print_only` isn\u0027t worth keeping as a separate option from JSON output - I don\u0027t feel strongly about this one way or another - then in a third CL delete `--print_only`.",
